			"Message": "feat(Rpc): Add UpdateArgument struct for configuration updates via RPC\n\nIntroduces a new deserializable struct in Mountain's RPC argument handling layer to support configuration update operations through the Track dispatcher. This struct:\n- Maps to CommonConfigurationTarget via u32 `Target` field\n- Supports null `Value` for key removal scenarios\n- Includes language scoping and override capabilities through `ScopeToLanguage` and `OverridesDto`\n\nEnables future implementation of configuration update handlers in Mountain's native logic flow, crucial for maintaining editor state consistency between Sky UI and extensions running in Cocoon. The serde-derived structure ensures proper JSON serialization/deserialization through Vine IPC, maintaining compatibility with VS Code extension shims in Path A implementation.\n\nThis directly contributes to MVP deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by providing the argument schema needed for configuration modification RPC calls from extensions.",
			"SHA": "81819ada17bacd4e787adcc80764bc269eeb0956"
		},
