			"Message": "feat(Track): Add ExecuteCommandArgument DTO for RPC command handling\n\n- Introduce ExecuteCommandArgument struct in Mountain's RPC command arguments module\n- Provides deserialization structure for command execution parameters via serde\n- Matches Track dispatcher's expected DTO format with proper field aliases (id/args)\n- Enables robust parsing of RPC commands received through Vine IPC layer\n- Supports upcoming implementation of command routing in Track dispatcher\n- Aligns with recent Vine JSON utilities work (Refs 0141ba4)",
