			],
			"Message": "feat(Mountain): Implement core environment with provider trait integrations\n\nAdded MountainEnvironment.rs as the central environment implementation for Mountain's backend services. This provides:\n- File system operations (FsReader/FsWriter) with path security validation\n- Configuration management via ConfigProvider/ConfigInspector\n- Document handling including open/save operations\n- Storage, secrets, and output channel management\n- UI dialog integrations through Tauri\n- IPC communication layer for sidecar interactions\n- Language feature provider registry for extension capabilities\n\nImplements security checks validating file access against workspace/app boundaries. Integrates with AppState for provider registrations and session management. This environment serves as the foundation for Mountain's service layer, enabling interaction with Cocoon sidecars and future extension hosts.\n\nAligns with MVP Path A deliverables by establishing core services required for VS Code extension compatibility. The modular provider pattern allows incremental implementation of features while maintaining the Echo API contract with Sky frontend.",
