			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add JSON value conversion utilities for Protobuf IPC\n\nIntroduce ProtoValueConverter module to handle bidirectional conversion between native serde_json::Value and Prost-generated JsonValueWrapper types. This enables consistent data representation in Vine IPC communications between Mountain and sidecar processes like Cocoon.\n\n- Implements JsValueToProtoValue to wrap JSON values while preserving null semantics\n- Provides ProtoValueToJsValue to unpack Protobuf wrappers with null fallback\n- Ensures type compatibility between Mountain's native logic and gRPC extension interfaces\n\nThis foundational work supports MVP Path A's Cocoon integration by facilitating reliable JSON data exchange through Vine IPC, crucial for shim-mediated extension communication. The explicit null handling maintains Echo API contract integrity during Sky<->Mountain interactions.",
