			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add window management RPC argument DTOs\n\nIntroduce structured argument definitions for window-related RPC calls in Mountain's IPC layer. This adds:\n- `OpenUriArgument` with options DTO for handling URI opening requests\n- `AsExternalUriArgument` with options DTO for URI conversion operations\n\nThese DTOs enable type-safe communication between Sky's UI and Mountain through the Vine IPC system, specifically supporting:\n1. Protocol handling for `vscode:/` URIs (MVP Deliverable #4)\n2. Window interaction flows required for extension host initialization\n3. Future workspace restoration features\n\nAligns with Path A strategy by expanding the Echo API contract surface area needed for Cocoon-side shims to make window management requests. The non-snake_case allowances reflect direct mapping to TypeScript interfaces in Shim element.",
