			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add secret management RPC argument DTOs\n\nIntroduce argument structures for secure secret handling in Mountain's IPC layer. The new `GetSecretArgument` and `SetSecretArgument` DTOs enable:\n- Encrypted transmission of sensitive data like passwords/API keys through Vine IPC\n- Standardized request/response patterns for secret operations\n- Integration with future secret storage implementations in Cocoon extensions\n\nThis foundational work supports MVP Path A's extension capabilities by providing essential security primitives for extension<->host communication. Aligns with MVP deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by enabling extension authentication flows.\n\nRefs #064f944, #36e9312",
