			],
			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add extension enablement state RPC argument DTOs\n\nIntroduces structured argument definitions for managing extension enablement state through Vine IPC. This aligns with Path A's requirement for Cocoon-based extension management by:\n- Creating `GetEnablementStateArgument` and `SetEnablementArgument` DTOs\n- Following established patterns from recent RPC argument additions (documents, diagnostics, config)\n- Enabling serialization of enablement state operations between Mountain and Cocoon processes\n\nThese DTOs support the extension lifecycle management required for MVP deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support), allowing Mountain to handle enable/disable requests via Track dispatcher while maintaining type-safe IPC communication through Vine.",
			"SHA": "064f94410313acf569695843e6967be8b4590c80"
