			"Date": "2025-06-06T23:44:56Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				410,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add document management RPC argument DTOs\n\nIntroduces serialization structures for document operations in Mountain's IPC layer:\n- Creates DTO modules for SaveAll, TryOpen, TrySave, and TrySaveAs operations\n- Aligns with ongoing Vine IPC implementation for Cocoon sidecar communication\n- Enables structured argument passing between Sky frontend and Mountain backend\n\nThese argument types form the foundation for handling VS Code extension document requests\nthrough Cocoon shims, supporting MVP Path A's extension compatibility goals. The DTO pattern\nensures type-safe serialization over Vine's JSON-based IPC transport layer, maintaining\nEcho API contract compliance across process boundaries.",
			"SHA": "36e93125a218dc585016ec29ec7b6f69713ab347"
