			"Date": "2025-06-06T23:41:20Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				392,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Cocoon): Implement gRPC cancellation handler for Mountain-initiated operation termination\n\nAdds cancellation request handler to Cocoon's gRPC server enabling Mountain to terminate long-running operations via Vine IPC. This completes the bidirectional cancellation flow between Mountain's Track dispatcher and Cocoon's extension host environment.\n\n- Processes CancelOperationRequest messages through new HandleCancel.ts module\n- Integrates with CancellationTokenRegistry to propagate cancellation signals to ongoing extension operations\n- Includes error handling and logging for registry availability issues\n- Follows pattern established in recent Vine gRPC implementation (2ff0d1d, 06588b7)\n\nEnables proper operation lifecycle management in Path A architecture, crucial for maintaining responsive UI during extension execution. Supports MVP deliverable #5 (Basic Extension Support) by ensuring cancellation capabilities parity with VS Code extension host expectations.",
			"SHA": "5e613432150b7862c3e42ec3c920a641c9629484"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2025-06-06T23:41:07Z",
