				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				390,
				1
			],
			"Message": "feat(Vine): Add gRPC client function for sending raw RPC data from Cocoon\n\nIntroduces `SendRpcDataToMountain` function in Mountain's gRPC client infrastructure to handle binary payload transmission for VS Code extension RPCProtocol requirements. The implementation:\n\n- Uses generated gRPC client stubs from `VineGrpcPb` to communicate with Mountain's service\n- Implements timeout handling and error refinement for Mountain-side RPC operations\n- Includes detailed logging for debugging IPC layer communication\n- Supports Cocoon shims needing to proxy VS Code extension communication through `Vine` IPC\n\nThis directly enables Path A (Cocoon sidecar) functionality by establishing the core transport mechanism for extension host RPC calls. The error wrapping pattern (`MountainGrpcRpcDataError`) aligns with Mountain's error handling strategies for sidecar communications.\n\nRefs #06588b7 (complementary Mountain-side request handler implementation)",
			"SHA": "2ff0d1d150eaf057a3d0582283d2d249b7d4990f"
		},
