			],
			"Message": "feat(Vine): Implement request handler for Cocoon-to-Mountain gRPC calls\n\nAdds core client-side implementation for sending RPC requests from Cocoon Node.js sidecar to Mountain backend via Vine IPC layer. The SendRequestToMountain function handles:\n- gRPC client initialization using shared instance\n- Parameter serialization with JsValueToProtoValue converter\n- Deadline enforcement and error handling for transport/application errors\n- Response deserialization via ProtoValueToJsValue\n- Detailed logging/tracing for debugging IPC flows\n\nThis directly enables Path A (Cocoon) extension communication by implementing the client-side counterpart to Mountain's gRPC service stubs added in commit 75d4608. The error refinement ensures Cocoon extensions receive structured errors matching VS Code API expectations through shim layers.\n\nRefs #75d460833c2d669b11d9595dee1609a58236f456",
