			"Message": "feat(Vine): Implement gRPC message definitions and service stubs for Mountain-Cocoon IPC\n\nAdded manually crafted Protobuf-compatible Rust structs and gRPC client/server traits in `VineGrpcPb.rs` to establish the core IPC communication layer between Mountain and Cocoon. This implementation:\n\n- Defines `JsonValueWrapper` with Prost compatibility to enable JSON payload handling in gRPC messages, crucial for maintaining compatibility with VS Code extension expectations\n- Implements generic request/response/notification structures (`GenericRequest`, `RpcError`, etc.) that form the foundation of the RPC protocol\n- Provides client and server stubs for bidirectional communication between Mountain's native backend and Cocoon's Node.js sidecar\n- Enables future extension to streaming/binary data through `RpcDataPayload`\n\nThis directly supports MVP Path A's requirement for functional extension hosting by establishing the gRPC-over-Vine-IPC mechanism that will be used by Cocoon's shims to proxy extension API calls to Mountain's native implementation. The manual implementation serves as a temporary stand-in until full tonic-build integration is completed.",
