			],
			"Message": "chore(Vine): Set up generated IPC module structure for gRPC communication\n\nAdded `Source/Ipc/Generated/mod.rs` as the foundation for Protobuf-generated types used in Vine's gRPC implementation. This module currently re-exports manually adapted structs from `VineGrpcManual` while establishing the pattern for future integration with `tonic-build`'s code generation.\n\n- Prepares for automated Protobuf code generation as part of MVP Path A's Cocoon sidecar communication\n- Maintains Prost compatibility to ensure efficient binary serialization between Mountain and extension hosts\n- Follows established IPC patterns from recent shim generator work (Refs 42207f6)\n- Enables type-safe RPC message handling through the Vine transport layer\n\nThis foundational work supports upcoming implementation of extension host communication required for VS Code API shim functionality.",
